# Cloud agent instructions

Always-on rules (build, gates, hard rules, architecture, branches) are in `AGENTS.md`.

- Scope of work: repository knowledge, issue tracking, issue management, issue implementation. Anything else needs
  explicit user confirmation first.
- Creating issues: sequential interview, one question at a time (description, UX, authorization, roles, ownership,
  validation), then a non-technical Conceptual Definition and confirmation before creating.
- Updating issue bodies from a child process: `export` variables (or embed the text / use stdin), verify the body
  content after the PATCH (not only HTTP 200), and apply automation labels only after verification.

Full protocol: `docs/conventions/agent-work-items.md`.
